      "description": "<p>Nidal Hasan sentenced to death by military jury in 2013 for carrying out deadly shooting attack at army base in Texas</p><p>Donald Trump has approved the execution by US army firing squad of Nidal Hasan, who was <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2013/aug/28/fort-hood-shooter-sentenced-death\">sentenced to death</a> for killing 13 soldiers at Fort Hood in 2009, chief Pentagon spokesperson Sean Parnell said in a social media post.</p><p>Hasan, who was an army psychiatrist, would become the first US soldier to be executed by the US military in more than 60 years.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/05/trump-fort-hood-shooter-execution\">Continue reading...</a>",
